# Brazen Collector (2/1) has first strike: blocked by Bot2's Memnite (1/1), it deals its 2 combat damage in the first-strike
# step, the Memnite dies as a state-based action, and so deals no damage back (CR 702.7b, 510.4); the Collector survives.
# Without first strike both would die. Attacking still added its R.

[Bot1 Deck]
Brazen Collector
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mountain x3
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brazen Collector.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Brazen Collector > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Bot1.Battlefield.Brazen Collector)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Brazen Collector.Damage = 0
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Mana = {R} lasting {R}
